# 8x10 seated occupant seen from BEHIND — the cutaway's over-the-shoulder read.
#
# Same footprint as `seated` so the pose routing and the desk geometry are
# untouched; only the head reverses. The face rows become hair exactly as
# `walking_back` reverses `walking`, so the two back views share one vocabulary
# and an agent recoloured in one is recoloured in the other.
#
# The bottom rows carry sleeve rather than the hands `seated` shows: from behind,
# the forearms are in front of the body and the desk occludes them anyway.
@frame 0
. n H H H H n .
n H H H H H H n
H H H H H H H H
H H H H H H H H
. H H H H H H .
. n H H H H n .
. B B B B B B .
B B B B B B B B
B B B B B B B B
. B B B B B B .
